\frac{1}{R_{\mathrm{eq}}} = \frac{6+1+3+2+6}{12}
\frac{1}{R_{\mathrm{eq}}} = \frac{18}{12}
Simplify the fraction:
\frac{1}{R_{\mathrm{eq}}} = \frac{3}{2}
